	(text "R_ILIM 90.9k 1 %: trip 256 / 292 / 335 mA (SLVS841 Eq. 1, SPEC §3.1). EN 100k pull-down: off after a power-on.\nFull scale 341 mA, LSB 10.4 uA (SPEC §3.4). FAULT -> SLOT_FAULT_N (all TPS2553s wired-OR).\nJP_3V3_S1: fit a jumper shunt to power the slot; remove it to put a meter in series (SPEC §3.3).\nKelvin (D4): IN+ / IN- through net ties NT44P / NT44N at R506's pads (SPEC §7.5)."
